  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68b3614ed265aec9bfe27f5bdd97648a2eb2daf3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68b3614ed265aec9bfe27f5bdd97648a2eb2daf3\" data-origin-width=\"673\" data-origin-height=\"375\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba019b8c60a8940db4daf88da8546b8e85aa39f0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba019b8c60a8940db4daf88da8546b8e85aa39f0\" data-origin-width=\"552\" data-origin-height=\"420\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddeb306c0ea57b2f52e2f0a183a130d852d2e7e1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddeb306c0ea57b2f52e2f0a183a130d852d2e7e1\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"548\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>2022에서 월식은 2학년에서</b><br><b>1학년으로 내려갔네요.</b><br>&#160;<br>쓸만한 이미지 캡처했습니다.&#160;<br><br><br>세상 이슈들이 많아 그런지<br>개기월식 뉴스는<br>좀 묻히는 느낌적인 느낌이 드네요. ^^;;<br>&#160;<br>개학 다음 주이기만 해도<br>뭐라도 해볼 텐데...&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">개학 날이라니....ㅜㅡㅜ !</span><br>&#160;<br><b>현수막 자료와 </b><br><b>명함 같이 뿌릴만한 카드도</b><br><b>만들어봤습니다!</b><br><br><br>&#160;<br>재과만쌤들<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">ㅋ</span><br>&#160;<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ef6f53;\">미리, 제 더위 사가세욤 ^^<br></span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65fda17fe7cdfb527043609198b7c628d080cfc7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65fda17fe7cdfb527043609198b7c628d080cfc7\" data-origin-width=\"300\" data-origin-height=\"211\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ee7ba0f9e03436429e0bef71c25e87eb2f8350a?download\" data-file-name=\"개기월식_카드_수정.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"333256\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D910%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20260223170004&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6ee7ba0f9e03436429e0bef71c25e87eb2f8350a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">개기월식_카드_수정</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">325.45KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>A4지 1장에 10개<br>명함크기 파일입니다.&#160;</b><br><b>뒷면엔 과학 명언이 있구요.&#160;<br></b><br>첫날 나이트 ㅋㅋ 그 분들이 날리듯<br>아이들에게 뿌려볼까 합니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d92c094fc91a4d836435933952f527cfdb80f229\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d92c094fc91a4d836435933952f527cfdb80f229\" data-origin-width=\"236\" data-origin-height=\"692\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">미리캔버스 링크입니다( 사본만들기 가능한 링크로 수정하였습니다~)<br><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v2/design2/v/97e332a0-2308-4ee1-8c52-1898b1ee1aa4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.miricanvas.com/v2/design2/v/97e332a0-2308-4ee1-8c52-1898b1ee1aa4</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"2026 개기월식\" data-og-description=\"디자인 전문가가 아니어도 무료 템플릿으로 손쉽게 원하는 디자인을 할 